### 1. Create a school first
POST http://localhost:8080/schools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring School"
}

### 2. Create a student using the real school ID returned above
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Yennie",
  "lastName": "Peng",
  "email": "yennie@example.com",
  "age": 20,
  "schoolId": 1
}

### Find all schools
GET http://localhost:8080/schools

### Find all students
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### Find one student
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1

### Search first name (case-insensitive, partial match)
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search/yen

### Delete one student
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/1
